; DOMAIN: beilinson-conjecture [CLOSED, derived 2026-07-25]
; Claim: Beilinson's conjecture relates special values of motivic L-functions to regulators. For a smooth projective variety X/Q and integers i,n with n outside the critical range, the Beilinson regulator r_D maps motivic cohomology H^i_M(X,Q(n)) (rationally = a piece of algebraic K-theory K_{2n-i}(X)^{(n)} by Adams eigenspaces) to Deligne-Beilinson cohomology H^i_D(X_R,R(n)). The conjecture: the integral part H^i_M(X,Z(n)) has rank equal to dim H^i_D, and its image under r_D is a Q-structure (lattice) whose covolume equals the leading coefficient L^*(H^{i-1}(X),n) up to a nonzero rational: L^*(M,n) ~_Q det(regulator). This is the archimedean/motivic parent of Bloch-Kato: Bloch-Kato refines it into an exact Tamagawa-number equality (period x regulator x #Sha / #torsion) and the p-adic Perrin-Riou regulator is its p-adic-tower analogue. Deligne's conjecture (critical n) is the special case where the regulator is a period. Known cases: Borel (number fields, K-theory of Z_F ~ Dedekind zeta), Beilinson (modular curves, Rankin-Selberg), Dirichlet class number formula (n=0 archetype).
; Bridge: genesis_perrin_riou (Beilinson is the archimedean regulator whose p-adic-tower counterpart is the Perrin-Riou big exponential; both regulate motivic/Selmer classes to L-values, one over C via Deligne cohomology, the other over Q_p via Bloch-Kato exp) + genesis_bloch_kato (Bloch-Kato is the exact Tamagawa refinement of Beilinson's rational-covolume statement, fixing the period/regulator ratio to (period x #Sha)/(#torsion x Tamagawa)) + genesis_k_theory (motivic cohomology H^i_M(X,Q(n)) = Adams eigenspace K_{2n-i}(X)^{(n)}; the Beilinson regulator is the Borel/Chern-class regulator on higher K-theory into Deligne cohomology).
(= (motivic-cohomology $X $n) (adams-eigenspace (k-theory $X) $n))
(= (beilinson-regulator $X $n) (map (motivic-cohomology $X $n) (deligne-cohomology $X $n)))
(= (q-structure $X $n) (lattice (image (beilinson-regulator $X $n))))
(= (beilinson-conjecture $M $n) (equal-up-to-rational (leading-l-value $M $n) (covolume (q-structure $M $n))))
(= (bloch-kato-refines (beilinson-conjecture $M $n)) (tamagawa-number $M $n))